    answer: Customer relationship management system (CRM)
  - id: 512-drill-09
    cue: A digital tool used to record and process payments, often integrated with the point of sale.
    answer: Payment processing system
  - id: 512-drill-10
    cue: A cloud-based tool that lets teams share documents, assign tasks, and communicate without being in the same office.
    answer: Collaboration platform (or productivity suite)
